            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>Our first release!

What's Changed



Jupyterbook skeleton by @jukent in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/1

first pass at deploying to gh pages by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/2

Try just html folder by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/3

Change toc and add footer by @jukent in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/4

upload entire _build dir by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/5

Add contributing to toc by @jukent in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/6

Fix license by @jukent in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/7

Switch theme to match other geocat documentation by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/13

add plotting template by @jukent in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/14

Minimal PR and issue templates by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/20

Add Pre-commit hooks by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/23

File structure by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/28

Preview, deployment, comments, publish by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/30

Add dependabot by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/34

Add CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/33

Bump peaceiris/actions-gh-pages from 3.9.3 to 4.0.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/35

Removed broken link in README by @andy-theia in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/42

Refinements to NCL and computational notebook templates by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/43

[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by @pre-commit-ci in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/49

Python datetime and days_in_month by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/44

Add day of week  by @andy-theia in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/51

Bump dawidd6/action-download-artifact from 3.1.4 to 5 by @dependabot in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/56

Bump dawidd6/action-download-artifact from 5 to 6 by @dependabot in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/57

Add initial CITATION.cff file by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/61


New Contributors



@jukent made their first contribution in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/1

@cyschneck made their first contribution in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/23

@dependabot made their first contribution in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/35

@andy-theia made their first contribution in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/42

@pre-commit-ci made their first contribution in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/49


Full Changelog: https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/commits/v2024.06.0</gco:CharacterString>
